+/***********************************************************************
+
+	KJ: Prone / crawl / dive - torso side.
+
+	Torso_Prone/Torso_Unprone are the one-handed grip transitions in/out.
+	Torso_Proned is the ONLY prone torso state that checks for fire input -
+	two-handed, stationary, matches Torso_Idle's fire routing. Torso_ProneCrawl
+	is one-handed and deliberately never checks fire input at all - per design,
+	the player must stop crawling (back to Torso_Proned) before they can shoot.
+	Torso_Dive is the dive-specific transition, timed by pm_divetime, and (like
+	Legs_Dive/Legs_Proned) doesn't care whether the player is grounded or still
+	mid-air when it finishes - that's what lets you shoot immediately after a
+	dive off a ledge, before you've even landed.
